{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102398","id":2314352362,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6J8jbq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102398","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102398","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d72006119dfd8dea6dbaf50c596e9f32d73dd4a5","number":102398,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add node started/finished signals for animation state machines","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10253.\r\n\r\nThe other half of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102165\r\n\r\nThis adds `node_started(StringName)` and `node_finished(StringName)` to `AnimationNodeStateMachinePlayback`. Grouped StateMachines have their signals propagated up to the parent state machine, with their name prefixed. For example, with the following state machine:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"692\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-02 at 4 53 10 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6a367ba-a126-470a-9615-35656ef6119c\" />\r\n\r\nOuter (grouped):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"746\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-02 at 4 53 21 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40a7b362-1109-4e66-9582-4c563d8cbec5\" />\r\n\r\nInner (grouped):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"759\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-02 at 4 53 31 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48682079-3b21-4e87-83b6-aebb9cae8dc7\" />\r\n\r\nthe signals on the root playback are:\r\n```\r\nState machine node started:  Start\r\nState machine node finished: Start\r\nState machine node started:  Outer/Inner/Attack1\r\nState machine node finished: Outer/Inner/Attack1\r\nState machine node started:  Outer/Attack2\r\nState machine node finished: Outer/Attack2\r\nState machine node started:  Hit1\r\nState machine node finished: Hit1\r\nState machine node started:  End\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godoten